# Event Audio Files Directory

This folder contains audio files for each event theme.
Download royalty-free audio from:
- https://pixabay.com/music/
- https://freesound.org/
- https://incompetech.com/music/

Required files:
- new-year.mp3 (fireworks/celebration ambience)
- ramadan.mp3 (islamic ambient/peaceful)
- eid-fitr.mp3 (celebration/festive)
- eid-adha.mp3 (celebration/festive)
- christmas.mp3 (christmas bells/ambient)
- independence-day.mp3 (patriotic/national)
- valentine.mp3 (romantic ambient)
- halloween.mp3 (spooky ambient)
- maulid-nabi.mp3 (islamic celebration)
- isra-miraj.mp3 (peaceful night ambient)
- islamic-new-year.mp3 (islamic ambient)
